      "competingExplanation": "The blank field may simply reflect administrative oversight rather than an unrecorded routing change; however, without evidence of a specific routing change affecting the boundary, this remains speculative. The requirement exists regardless of whether a change occurred, but its application depends on such a change happening.","evidenceGap": "No record confirms that a service-routing change actually affected the maintenance boundary or was implemented prior to the incident. Evidence needed: documentation showing any recent changes to instrument-air routing affecting RHOB's receiving header H-R and 1SC dryer group D-101, including timestamps and authorization records."
