  "decision": {
    "summary": "The investigation identifies a potential causal link between the blank temporary instruction attachment field (n-nrva0b) and the requirement for ECP revision or approved temporary instructions when service-routing changes affect maintenance boundaries (n-vay2a6). However, no evidence confirms that such a change occurred in this case. The status of this edge remains unknown due to lack of corroborating records about routing changes.",
